{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["mcp"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Add a crop or batch"},"description":"Add something the person grows or keeps, the way the app does, and\nDivisi schedules its tasks. `what` is in their words: a crop (\"maize\"),\nor animals (\"broilers\", \"layers\", \"road runners\", \"goats\", \"tilapia\",\n\"bees\"); `kind` is worked out from it unless given.\n\nA crop goes on a field: `target_planting_date` is the day they mean to\nplant, `planting_date` only if it is already in the ground.\nAnimals: `count` (needed for poultry), `start_date` (the day they\narrived; today if left out) and optionally `ready_date`, the day they\nexpect to sell, which is added as a task.\n\n`place` is the field, coop, pen, pond or apiary, by name or id; a new\nname makes one. Left out, the farm's only place of that kind is used.\nOnly farm owners and managers can add one. Pass the same `client_id` (a\nUUID) to retry safely.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"area_hectares":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Area Hectares"},"client_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Client Id"},"count":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Count"},"farm_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Farm Id"},"kind":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["CROP","BROILERS","LAYERS","VILLAGE_CHICKENS","LIVESTOCK","FISH","BEES"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Kind"},"name":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Name"},"place":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Place"},"planting_date":{"anyOf":[{"format":"date","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Planting Date"},"ready_date":{"anyOf":[{"format":"date","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Ready Date"},"start_date":{"anyOf":[{"format":"date","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Start Date"},"target_planting_date":{"anyOf":[{"format":"date","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Target Planting Date"},"what":{"title":"What","type":"string"}},"required":["what"],"title":"add_unitArguments","type":"object"},"name":"add_unit","outputSchema":{"properties":{"farm_id":{"title":"Farm Id","type":"string"},"finish_in_divisi":{"default":"","title":"Finish In Divisi","type":"string"},"finish_link":{"default":"","title":"Finish Link","type":"string"},"head_count":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Head Count"},"kind":{"title":"Kind","type":"string"},"link":{"title":"Link","type":"string"},"name":{"title":"Name","type":"string"},"next_tasks":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"title":"Next Tasks","type":"array"},"place_created":{"title":"Place Created","type":"boolean"},"planting_date":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Planting Date"},"ready_date":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Ready Date"},"started":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Started"},"summary":{"title":"Summary","type":"string"},"target_planting_date":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Target Planting Date"},"tasks_planned":{"title":"Tasks Planned","type":"integer"},"unit_id":{"title":"Unit Id","type":"string"},"what":{"title":"What","type":"string"},"zone_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Zone Id"}},"required":["summary","unit_id","farm_id","kind","name","what","place_created","tasks_planned","next_tasks","link"],"title":"UnitAdded","type":"object"},"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["mcp"],"type":"oauth2"}],"title":"Add a crop or batch"}
